### Summary

Completed the *CyberChef — The Basics* room, focused on using CyberChef to transform, decode, encode, extract, and inspect different forms of data.

The tool itself is fairly simple. Most operations can be selected, dragged into a recipe, and immediately applied to an input.

The larger challenge was understanding what each operation actually represents.

